  "b6_answer": "3",
  "b6_reason": "Lens maker's formula gives f = 20 cm = 0.2 m for a biconvex lens with both radii 20 cm and n = 1.5, so P = 1/f = +5 D.",
  "b6_working": "1/f = (n-1)(1/R1 - 1/R2) with R1 = +20 cm, R2 = -20 cm: 1/f = 0.5 x (1/20 + 1/20) = 0.5 x (1/10) = 1/20 per cm, so f = 20 cm = 0.2 m. P = 1/f(in m) = 1/0.2 = +5 D.",
